      "text": "$t1 == '292'?\r\n`",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:66443:66459"
    },
    {
      "id": "292:p1",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:66459:66461"
    },
    {
      "id": "292:p2",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "你推开门，准备跑路。寒冷的空气洗过你的全身，让你停住。你慢慢呼吸着，让心跳慢下来。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:66461:66504"
    },
    {
      "id": "292:p3",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "外面这么黑，跑出去无异于自杀。你终于放松下来，决定留下。暂时还是呆在小屋里比较好。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:66504:66547"
    },
    {
      "id": "292:p4",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "你伴侣还是有可能现在回来。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:66547:66562"
    },
    {
      "id": "292:p5",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "外面又黑又冷。风从门前的空地吹过，沿着车道吹进森林的深处。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:66562:66593"
    },
    {
      "id": "292:p6",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "进行一次聆听检定。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:66593:66604"
    },
    {
      "id": "292:p7",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "如果检定成功，转到 225。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:66604:66620"
    },
    {
      "id": "292:p8",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "如果检定失败，转到 228。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:66620:66636"
    }
  ]
}
